    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42097" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rūtrum</span></b> , i, n.
		ruo, cf. <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 134</span></i>
			Müll.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> An
			implement for digging, <i>a spade</i>, <i>shovel</i>, <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 10, 3</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">11, 4</span></i>; Varr. and Pompon. ap.
				<i><span class="en">Non. 18, 22 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 28,
			45</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 4, 843</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> For mixing mortar, <i>a
				trowel</i>, <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 128</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Vitr. 7,
				3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 36, 23, 55, § 177</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 15</span></i>.</div>
